    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0dd06da0657c6f84ef6c50c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼…可能已经累了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdea8981065f871c14c1e17c6df427faf311a43d4ceeee8719e55b2754205942",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f93cd851e5861a94bb41fe39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊…今天可不要发呆…\n不像样子，要努力啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ff42d47c950fcf6a835659edbd2d3d4bb840aa102246bd9acbf98389cc63837",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cddbe140b2ca2d773a7f0d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟，要开整吗！\n…啊…抱歉，还是忘了刚才的话吧。\n干劲充足过头了。好羞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "020e8252c3c87cca54f482c53fb2849f56948a2ac15f3e32eeaa60d4670cd501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0243ddedef937ff53577a1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，也许可以\n去比较好的地方呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc0f4b8f8d0be9ea7d58510154e6d582e473c2d11ec3fdfd994b349522e82bde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dcb99fdb5edd5a79b87bbb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚步好像有点轻快？\n是说状态很好吗。\n…可能是心理作用吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ab6321a90308f7f3d77b9fb4634fb39d781fb572f23db28f9bd97bce1543ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0edf170517b570d94cf736e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的好的。是非常\n精神的内恰哦。\n今天的训练内容是什么呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b35ca3d1772629d75b7ec15fefc29b8d8f288e8c0e0e7208e81d55ca2fad9e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca2c6d110486ab8a87155c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么那么。\n今天也要\n好好的加油啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d75c59f4f03cf31ae62c9019cb95e69963410b3a310ec525096d2beb2a3223",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61da24a359ad692941b785ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的，什么时候开始？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a247c9d8aab52eb67223ceec65746c94940163c841998e796ba6f3e96f08d10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c912ed46bcc0d3185c2c0ba0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯ー…\n干劲，是不是掉到哪里去了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fe60861f5e515a25e4b5e04ea03928f6ff2c795658340be59c7ea4f3a00f570",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a3a30481a2c947d39f99b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊…为什么。\n不知不觉的，已经…没有力气了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "95abd63419d0eea400015eee45ddc40f6e7127e33ac491f03908145d4fea2b94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:763c016c9f3b6f7bccbc1340",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊ー！不行！\n只能想到最坏的结果。\n…必须冷静。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3159297e58e5e68994d327a674aa818ecfcae73d197c0ca7ec6dead6caa1a1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec70e13f5581f5d5c2e78b82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜，状态好差。\n明明是该坚持的时候ー…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fda8a8248259aa155429bc486a66ea6a592857e4833a38427c78a03863be66c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d527232c241258e2d8481e96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，又要比赛？…没关系吗。\n希望不会影响到身体状况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb5d3bfa76f7e88c5dec3dffe12ecae8b58a989ae022d1a8e68bbe942750a0ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecee023953e20da606d56737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛果然还是太多了吧？\n为了保持状态良好。\n差不多也休息一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f400a54413069034caa4878acbdb99c7008d91df90edb59d3ed30685af5b1ad9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9986f1fcb5b5673ecdf9a9cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊～、这个时候终于来了呢。\n状态…嘛，还行吧。嗯。\n说不定…之类的呢，啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936b6ca696b74dd20459bfcf4d505e0d0a75c794c810f3b6b503e7e11fa5fd21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2483019aeac8031484508a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力得也差不多了，\n胜算…我想应该有。\n…不如说，我想有啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ca20d3a37396c54ec28b636210c56ad778c3d9779864ea93f0bd84175688484",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
